WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:06.400
Why not break the pastry in two—half for each of us?

00:08.320 --> 00:13.500
You speak truly! Just as when you two were little boys: half for each.

00:16.480 --> 00:18.600
This way, neither brother is slighted!

00:24.040 --> 00:27.000
Later on, I will bake plenty more and send them to you both.

00:28.880 --> 00:30.200
Thank you, Imperial Mother!
